 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Telegram end-to-end encryption library (static library)
 tde2e is the end-to-end encryption library from TDLib, built on its own via
 upstream's TD_E2E_ONLY option. Telegram Desktop 6.0 and later require it for
 encrypted group calls and link it unconditionally on Linux.
 .
 This package ships static libraries, their headers and a CMake package
 configuration providing the tde2e::tde2e target. There is no shared library
 and therefore no runtime package: anything linking tde2e must be rebuilt when
 this package changes.
 .
 Built from the exact upstream commit that the corresponding Telegram Desktop
 release pins.
